<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CRA Managed Care lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CRA Managed Care lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns confirmed on Wednesday it lowered its rating on the shares of CRA Managed Care Inc to attractive from buy, based on valuation.  </p>
<p>-- Analyst A.J. Rice's office said the stock had made a strong move higher recently, and the downgrade was based on the share price.</p>
<p>-- CRA Managed Care closed at 53.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
